# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Blacksmithing --out` from Era-baseline data. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/blacksmithing
title Blacksmithing 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Era-baseline data:
# Blizzard Classic Era client tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents,
# vendor prices) via wago.tools, pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated
# trainer list checked against npcs.json. Nothing public confirms Forever
# changed profession recipes, so the Era recipe list is the baseline.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-45  Rough Sharpening Stone (about 68)
#    45-75  Rough Grinding Stone (about 54)
#    75-93  Coarse Grinding Stone (about 31)
#    93-125 Runed Copper Belt (about 36)
#   125-137 Heavy Sharpening Stone (about 23)
#   137-150 Rough Bronze Leggings (about 14)
#   150-170 Patterned Bronze Bracers (about 32)
#   170-190 Silvered Bronze Gauntlets (about 46)
#   190-200 Green Iron Bracers (about 13)
#   200-210 Solid Sharpening Stone (about 30)
#   210-225 Golden Scale Bracers (about 23)
#   225-235 Steel Breastplate (about 13)
#   235-255 Steel Plate Helm (about 72)
#   255-260 Dense Sharpening Stone (about 12)
#   260-272 Heavy Mithril Boots (about 30)
#   272-275 Big Black Mace (about 11)
#   275-280 Ornate Thorium Handaxe (about 5)
#   280-300 Huge Thorium Battleaxe (about 20)

step Apprentice Blacksmithing
  tip Blacksmithing runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 17s in all.
  train Blacksmithing Apprentice
  skill Blacksmithing 1

